@base = http://localhost:3005
@token = paste-token-from-login-response
@blogId = paste-created-blog-id

### Create a fictional local demo user
POST {{base}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo-reader","name":"Demo Reader","password":"local-demo-password"}

### Log in, then copy token into @token above
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo-reader","password":"local-demo-password"}

### Create a blog (copy returned id into @blogId)
POST {{base}}/api/blogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Learning API testing","author":"Demo Author","url":"https://example.com/testing"}

### Public list
GET {{base}}/api/blogs

### Users and their blogs, excluding password hashes
GET {{base}}/api/users

### Like a blog
PUT {{base}}/api/blogs/{{blogId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"likes":1}

### Only its creator can delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/blogs/{{blogId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
